# Champion's Victory's CheckSVar$ X (PlayerCountPropertyYou$HasPropertyBeenAttackedThisCombat,
# PlayerProperty.java:477-483) asks whether the caster was attacked, not
# whether anyone attacks: human attacks ai, so in human's own declare attackers
# step, with an attacking creature to target and the mana paid for, the cast
# is refused (SpellAbilityRestriction.java:508-515) before any target is
# chosen -- no "queue targets" line, and the spell stays in hand.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 3
declareattackers
tapformana human 2 U
castspell human 1
# On to the declare blockers step, which empties the unspent mana.
advance
